    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20711" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hippăcē</span></b> ,
		ēs, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱππάκη</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Cheese made of mare's milk</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 28,
				9, 34, § 131</span></i>; <i><span class="en">28, 14, 58, §
			204</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
